  "details": "Once the Update was launched I got on VRC and looked for it how to disable the limiter or increase the value, after I did try both, I realised that the dynamic Bones in my Hair are still stiff as stone. Then I decided to go to someone else that I know who will have their limiter off and weirdly even for these people my hair looks like there are no dynamic bones in it and even weirder the bones in my tail are working just fine,\n\nI know it´s alittle much, but here are my dynamic bone stats on my avatar\n\nDynamic Bone Transforms: 65\nCollision Checks: around 1700\nDynamic Bone Colliders: 24\nDynamic Bone Components: 7\n\nfrom all the Dynamic Bone Components there is only 1 working the one for my Tail\nI even tried to reupload the Avatar and nothing happend\nand as I said, I tested it with a few people already, this problem is NOT client sided, because everyone even people with the limiter turned off can´t see my hair moving at all",
